2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F2636%2F2636.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ナチュラルファームシティ農園ホテル　＜秩父の街並みを眼下に望むロケーション＞ の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">💡 埼玉・秩父長瀞・小江戸川越・大宮旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            関東屈指の霊山「三峯神社（みつみねじんじゃ）」の参拝のコツは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 標高1100mの山頂に鎮座し、オオカミを神の使い（お犬さま）として祀る神社で、日本武尊やヤマトタケルの神話、毎月1日や早朝の神秘的な雲海が有名です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            国指定名勝・天然記念物「長瀞の岩畳（ながとろのいわだたみ）」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 荒川沿いに幅約50m・長さ約600mにわたって結晶片岩の平らな岩が畳を敷き詰めたように広がる絶景で、船頭が竿一本で下る『長瀞ライン下り』が人気です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            秩父のSL列車「パレオエクスプレス」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 秩父鉄道（熊谷〜三峰口間）を走るC58形蒸気機関車で、レトロな客車から荒川の渓谷美や秩父の山並みを眺めながらノスタルジックな鉄道旅が楽しめます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！埼玉県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 埼玉県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kanto-chichibu-soba-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】関東 秩父新そば・和栗・秋の山菜会席と自家源泉の温泉宿特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秩父・長瀞</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chichibu-onsen-ryokan-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】秩父温泉おすすめ宿・日帰り温泉・和の寛ぎ露天風呂ガイド！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秩父・長瀞</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/hanno-naguri-onsen-tokorozawa-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】飯能・名栗温泉・熊谷おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">飯能市・所沢市・熊谷市・秩父郡（名栗温泉・宮沢湖・メッツァビレッジ・所沢サクラタウン・森林公園）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kawagoe-koedo-tokinokane-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】小江戸川越おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">川越市（本川越駅・川越駅・蔵造りの町並み一番街・時の鐘・菓子屋横丁・喜多院）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/ibaraki-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【茨城県】【2026年最新】茨城おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">茨城県全域（大洗ひたちなか海浜公園・筑波山つくば土浦・水戸偕楽園袋田の滝・北茨城五浦海岸鹿島）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tochigi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【栃木県】【2026年最新】栃木おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">栃木県全域（世界遺産日光・中禅寺湖・鬼怒川温泉・那須高原・宇都宮）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/gunma-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【群馬県】【2026年最新】群馬おすすめ名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">群馬県全域（草津温泉・伊香保温泉・みなかみ温泉郷・四万温泉）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chiba-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【千葉県】【2026年最新】千葉おすすめホテル・温泉リゾート10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">千葉県全域（舞浜浦安TDR・南房総館山鴨川・銚子九十九里・木更津鋸山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}